    "features": [
      "Robust Electrical Cable: Heavy Duty 10 AWG 600V SOOW (Service, Oil, and Water Resistant) cable is a type of electrical wire that is commonly used in industrial; commercial, and outdoor applications; It is insulated; and is covered by a durable rubber jacket that provides resistance to oils, acids, water, and chemicals ; making it a durable and long-lasting option for harsh environments (-40C to 90 Celcius)",
      "Enhanced Conductivity: The 10 Gauge 3-Conductor OFC cable is constructed with stranded pure copper conductors; OFC wiring delivers superior conductivity; allowing it to handle larger currents with ease; Additionally OFC cable exhibits significantly higher corrosion resistance and improved heat dissipation; Flame retardant grade V0",
      "Versatile Applications: SOOW electrical wire is widely employed in industrial settings; as well as outdoor and marine applications; Thanks to its rubber insulation and jacket; this cable is well-suited for environments where exposure to these elements is common; Typical applications include power generation, mining operations, oil and gas exploration; Construction Equipment and Power Extension Cord",
      "Simplicity and Reliability: Energeaster's cables is extremely flexible oxygen free copper strands; durable and abrasion resistant outer insulation CPE insulation jacket; Internal conducters insulated with cotored coded extremely flexible FPDM insulation",
      "Quality Assurance: Insulation resistant to abrasion, battery acid,diesel fuel, engine coolant, engine oil, ethanol,extreme temperatures, flame, gasoline, power-steering ituid, transmission fluid, and water; Rated for outdoor use; Meets or exceeds 720 hours UV resistant aging test"
    ],
